Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Markov model with bigram encoding", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"d073459d-127b-439c-b315-94de6963b699"],

Cell["\<\
A reservoir architecture implementing a soft higher-order Markov model, \
functioning as a sequence memory. The system has three stages:

1. A delay plus a heteroencoder mints each consecutive token pair into a \
fresh SHR. The pair is block-coded, so order matters, and there is one random \
code per bigram.

2. The reservoir is a loop of period 2, with two interleaved reservoirs.

3. The temporal readout memory  reads x_t and R1 merged into one block.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cb334cf2-5b06-48fb-9c74-9a9f420a234a"],

